    "name": "Talewarden: Riders of the New Day",
    "steam_appid": 3250420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you heard the story about the Riders of the Night and Talewarden?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We heard...you were one of them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/3309fb4a0a75c7d0648d9fb4b77b29c4.avif?t=1752154226\" width=655 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Talewarden, you fall on an alien planet called Notoria. Explore over 30 different locations, each holding clues that reveal what\u2019s happening here. Venture west to uncover why time stands still, discover the source of the eerie voice in your mind, and choose whether to restore time or find a way to return.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/f778c2a3a0984dbee70909fe2f788994.poster.avif?t=1752154226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/f778c2a3a0984dbee70909fe2f788994.webp?t=1752154226\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/0966c9623cb86eb22812cac585f9d2ca.avif?t=1752154226\" width=655 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join 7 forgotten artists, the Riders of the Night, each from a different world. Gather around 10 campfires to talk, share hobbies and influence their relationships. Each of them holds a bitter story of unfulfilled goals that you can help them achieve on their loyalty quests.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/636bfa6e003335e5690c295a83665107.avif?t=1752154226\" width=800 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/9b31ed71f25df035adf019045b12fbf0.poster.avif?t=1752154226\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/9b31ed71f25df035adf019045b12fbf0.webm?t=1752154226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/9b31ed71f25df035adf019045b12fbf0.mp4?t=1752154226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/5600442943c37e889b2437e05d05108b.avif?t=1752154226\" width=655 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance one of three potential love interests. Stand by them as they search for a meaning. Stay loyal, when they're jealous, and experience their individual story arcs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/d2c46c58878ac4c80aa2a27d45a93672.avif?t=1752154226\" width=639 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/d9f755f6098c73d7a6ef8edc5ed9e87a.avif?t=1752154226\" width=639 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/30e7a74864d4b1c9b4833657cc364879.avif?t=1752154226\" width=639 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/37d4b68cf6529cf2688cb86e569774e0.avif?t=1752154226\" width=655 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Notoria - Use point-and-click elements, collect resources and interact with over 30 queer friendly side characters. Investigate locations and interview lone wanderers, all to solve mysteries you find along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/bb4371b8a1d007569d73f4925b18e6a6.poster.avif?t=1752154226\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/bb4371b8a1d007569d73f4925b18e6a6.webm?t=1752154226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/extras/bb4371b8a1d007569d73f4925b18e6a6.mp4?t=1752154226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A branching narrative focused on characters </strong>\u2013 Bond with your companions and shape their relationships to unlock multiple events. Your choices and affection you'll establish can lead to four distinct endings and several hidden ones. \u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich story</strong> \u2013 You\u2019ve many mysteries to uncover. Why does the voice in your mind urge you to follow the roots? Why were you and your companions brought here from different worlds? What lies far to the west? And why does Daydra eat paper?\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LGBTQ+ friendly cast </strong>- Talk with your companions around 10 campfires about art, life, lost dreams, and hardships to discover their unique backstories, and complete their loyalty quests.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance</strong> \u2013 A sulky Sheriff, a blunt Storm Sailor, and an alien Librarian. Win their sympathy, let them fall madly in love, and beware of their jealousy.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspect, Interview, Investigate </strong>- Use point-and-click elements to inspect various locations and gather items. Interview characters to gain valuable information and investigate mysteries to reach a good or bad conclusion.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 65\u00a0backgrounds -</strong> Including 30 explorable locations which you can visit via your journal and over 25 CGs.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your character </strong>- By selecting your pronouns and hobbies. Choose one of four emotions to unlock special dialogue options and interactions.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
